# The Cloudflare deploy target, in ONE place (docs/DEPLOY-CLOUDFLARE.md). Read by scripts/upload-artifacts.sh,
# scripts/deploy-app.sh (which writes wrangler.toml from wrangler.toml.example with these values) and
# `node scripts/deploy-manifest.mjs --commands`. An environment variable of the same name overrides a line here.
#
# Default = "the lean4game way": the showcase's artifacts live under their own prefix of the R2 bucket that QED64
# already uses (wasm64-lean4game uses prefix lean4game/ in the same bucket), uploaded through the existing rclone
# remote. Own-bucket alternative: R2_BUCKET=qed64-showcase-artifacts R2_PREFIX= (see the guide, "Own bucket").
R2_REMOTE=qed64-r2
R2_BUCKET=qed64-artifacts
R2_PREFIX=qed64-showcase/
WORKER_NAME=qed64-showcase
